produces a mere 44 bytes long file.
some versions after the commit=20

pointed above create a file that is bigger
than 44 bytes, but plays=20

nothing at all.

I just checked the rear microphone,and the result is=20

the same.=20

I attached my codec0 and lspci -vvv output, please let me=20

know if you
need anything else.

best,
vasilis


